direct.sh`. Its timing loop is now a code block in `baseline.md` that reads the templates directly inside the container.\n- I dropped the spawn request for shortening ConvertService's sync polling to stay under the budget. The finding (sync mode answers in whole seconds because of `CONVERT_ASYNC_DELAY = 1000`) is still in `baseline.md` as a candidate improvement, so someone else will need to file it.\n- I didn't run the measurements again, so the numbers are the same ones from the first attempt.\n\nAll of this is written up in the Executor log of the packet.\n\n**Lessons for the Atlas:**\n- Spawn requests and sample files both count toward `max_files_changed`, so count them before committing.\n- For benchmarks with the docker image, set `services.CoAuthoring.request-filtering-agent.allowPrivateIPAddress: true`, or every ConvertService call fails with `error: -4`.\n- Open the editors through the container's bridge IP on port 80, not `127.0.0.1:8080`, or save fails.\n- Packets that need upstream GitHub data need network or GitHub permissions granted to the executor first.","ttft_ms":2541,"type":"result","duration_ms":70490,"uuid":"f083a6c9-58d0-4d4b-95e6-690331213780","ttft_stream_ms":1113,"time_to_request_ms":417,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":6,"system_prompt":188,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":3,"input_attachments":17,"input_hooks":3,"conversation_append":0,"transcript_persist":22,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":6,"init_frame_send":3,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":4,"message_prep":0,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":2,"request_announcements":11,"query_setup":3,"auto_mode_context_wait":9,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":26,"message_normalization":3,"client_creation":97,"request_build":12},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":50,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":247,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":217,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":141,"process_rss_mib_result":248,"process_anon